      "classification": "apparent_same_scope_conflict",
      "reason": "Claim 1 states a general 25% tariff on auto imports was announced. Claim 2 states Hyundai's plant 'dodged' these tariffs. While one is the rule and the other an exception, they describe the same policy announcement with conflicting applicability outcomes (general imposition vs specific evasion).",
      "requires_current_authority_verification": false
    },
    "conflict_b6ea8658d1cbe437036e37a1": {
      "classification": "apparent_same_scope_conflict",
      "reason": "Claim 1 states the plant 'dodged' tariffs. Claim 2 quotes CEO saying cars produced there will be 'exempted'. These are complementary claims explaining the same outcome (non-applicability) rather than contradictory ones.",
      "requires_current_authority_verification": false
